## Tech Stack
- Next.js 15 with React 18
- State: Redux Toolkit with Redux Persist
- Data: Apollo Client (GraphQL) + React Query (polling)
- UI: Material-UI (MUI) + Tailwind CSS
- Auth: Auth0
- Testing: Jest + Storybook
